Subject: [PATCH 06/11] test: add direct-guacd text-output e2e harness
 (SSH/telnet/k8s)

Adds a manual end-to-end test harness for the text-output feature that
speaks the Guacamole protocol directly to guacd, complementing the
existing web-app tunnel smoke test.

- text-output-guacd-e2e.py: minimal guacd protocol client; performs the
  handshake and captures/decodes the outbound STDOUT pipe (stdlib only).
- text-output-k8s-exec-mock.py: mock Kubernetes exec WebSocket endpoint
  (v4.channel.k8s.io) emitting ANSI on channel 1, so the kubernetes
  protocol can be validated without a real cluster.
- text-output-e2e.sh: runs positive (raw ANSI teed to STDOUT pipe) and
  negative (default-off / disable-copy gate -> no pipe) checks for all
  three terminal protocols.
- README plus EXTRA_DIST entries.

Refs #3

